  "body": "This is an incredibly rare opportunity to build your dream home! It's hard to find a prime waterfront section like this in all of Auckland. Imagine waking up every morning to breathtaking sunrise views and living a vibrant, active lifestyle. The land spans 1371 square meters, providing ample space for you to unleash your imagination and create your perfect home.\r\n\r\nOpen your curtains in the morning and enjoy the stunning views of Rangitoto volcano and the entire Auckland city center. The section is only a few minutes' drive from the center of Gulf Harbour, where you can easily access supermarkets and cafes for your leisure time. If you're a golf enthusiast, the Gulf Harbour Country Club is nearby, and the Fairway Bay marina is just a stone's throw away. Take a stroll in Shakespeare Park with your family and friends and enjoy the beauty of nature.\r\n\r\nThe future value appreciation potential of this property is undeniable, as the Auckland government's O Mahurangi Penlink project is currently under construction. Once completed, you will have quick access to the State Highway 1 (specific project updates can be found on the council website). In addition, this property is included in the planning area of Whangaparaoa College, which offers an additional advantage for families with school-aged children.\r\n\r\nDon't let this exceptional opportunity slip through your fingers! Contact us today for more information and let us help you create your perfect home!",
